{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Online Matches &amp; Official Play Time\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our official play time is every Friday at 9:00 PM EST / 6:00 PM PST.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this time, more players are online and matchmaking is easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside official hours, you can still find players and play matches in private lobbies (1v1, 2v1, 2v2).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to enjoy matches with your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Popular YouTuber \u201cHirochinkun\u201d Praised TPBC!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access launches on January 16, 2026 (JST)\uff01\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could bring your favorite FPS/TPS button layouts onto the basketball court?<br>\u201cTPBC\u201d is a one-of-a-kind third-person basketball game that fuses the pinpoint aiming and smooth character control of shooters with the intense, fast-paced action of basketball.<br>Pull off spin moves, crossovers, and step-backs while locking onto the rim and firing your shot. Rack up points with your refined skills and unique playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer battles against players worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-court 2v2 matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump shots demand not only accuracy but also shot speed depending on distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of shooting motions including layups, floaters, and fadeaways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Context-based passing such as bounce passes, overhand passes, and behind-the-back passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus mini-game: Three-Point Contest</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396100?t=1773653966","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396100?t=1773653966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396100/fd0831beaed0fb569ef5934c0ba4371a32407225/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773653966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396100/fd0831beaed0fb569ef5934c0ba4371a32407225/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773653966","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Online Matches &amp; Official Play Time\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our official play time is every Friday at 9:00 PM EST / 6:00 PM PST.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this time, more players are online and matchmaking is easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside official hours, you can still find players and play matches in private lobbies (1v1, 2v1, 2v2).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to enjoy matches with your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Popular YouTuber \u201cHirochinkun\u201d Praised TPBC!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access launches on January 16, 2026 (JST)\uff01\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could bring your favorite FPS/TPS button layouts onto the basketball court?<br>\u201cTPBC\u201d is a one-of-a-kind third-person basketball game that fuses the pinpoint aiming and smooth character control of shooters with the intense, fast-paced action of basketball.<br>Pull off spin moves, crossovers, and step-backs while locking onto the rim and firing your shot. Rack up points with your refined skills and unique playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer battles against players worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-court 2v2 matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump shots demand not only accuracy but also shot speed depending on distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of shooting motions including layups, floaters, and fadeaways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Context-based passing such as bounce passes, overhand passes, and behind-the-back passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus mini-game: Three-Point Contest</p></li></ul>","developers":["kuroki-gaming"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Epic Online Services (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396100/35dee5610ca5d7132903044d474675fa26fea65d/header.jpg?t=1773653966","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396100/6025968/1153c94ae006a50aed765d5e12ea279e5391ba84/1773532159/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773532565","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396100/6025968/1153c94ae006a50aed765d5e12ea279e5391ba84/1773532159/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773532565","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396100/60259